    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the hidden pages of <i>Jurnal Risa</i> comes a visual novel where the boundary between the living and the unseen begins to blur. Step into Jurnal Risa's world where each shadow holds a story, and every whisper leads you deeper into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness the resurrection of the forspoken nemesis of <i>Jurnal Risa</i> crew that was never told before. Unveil its dark destiny within this horror-adventure game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the tale of Jurnal Risa, as recounted to me by Risa herself. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Paranormal Adventure Mystery</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417470/extras/352c5aedf83117d168a6a4aca5628628.poster.avif?t=1753077130\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417470/extras/352c5aedf83117d168a6a4aca5628628.webm?t=1753077130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417470/extras/352c5aedf83117d168a6a4aca5628628.mp4?t=1753077130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jurnal Risa is known for exploring haunted places and sharing true ghost stories from Indonesia. Their adventures, bonds, and spiritual encounters inspire the game\u2019s mystery and emotional depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brought to Life with Full Voice Acting</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417470/extras/d99d1c53cb70de4c3f807412a2c8a33b.poster.avif?t=1753077130\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417470/extras/d99d1c53cb70de4c3f807412a2c8a33b.webm?t=1753077130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417470/extras/d99d1c53cb70de4c3f807412a2c8a33b.mp4?t=1753077130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voiced by the real members of the group, each scene feels authentic as it captures their unique personalities, real-life bonds, and the emotional weight behind every supernatural encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mini games</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417470/extras/b40d9cadd140474d0b4457d6be42cf04.poster.avif?t=1753077130\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417470/extras/b40d9cadd140474d0b4457d6be42cf04.webm?t=1753077130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417470/extras/b40d9cadd140474d0b4457d6be42cf04.mp4?t=1753077130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a break from the tension with fun mini-games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect the Fragments of the Past</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417470/extras/226484a82d6ab3eb7954ab8806bab65a.poster.avif?t=1753077130\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417470/extras/226484a82d6ab3eb7954ab8806bab65a.webm?t=1753077130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417470/extras/226484a82d6ab3eb7954ab8806bab65a.mp4?t=1753077130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather collectible photos as you complete stories and challenges. Each photo unlocks a memory or reveals a hidden piece of the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ready to turn the last page and face what lingers beyond?</h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the hidden pages of <i>Jurnal Risa</i> comes a visual novel where the boundary between the living and the unseen begins to blur. Step into Jurnal Risa's world where each shadow holds a story, and every whisper leads you deeper into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness the resurrection of the forspoken nemesis of <i>Jurnal Risa</i> crew that was never told before. Unveil its dark destiny within this horror-adventure game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the tale of Jurnal Risa, as recounted to me by Risa herself. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Paranormal Adventure Mystery</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417470/extras/352c5aedf83117d168a6a4aca5628628.poster.avif?t=1753077130\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417470/extras/352c5aedf83117d168a6a4aca5628628.webm?t=1753077130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417470/extras/352c5aedf83117d168a6a4aca5628628.mp4?t=1753077130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jurnal Risa is known for exploring haunted places and sharing true ghost stories from Indonesia. Their adventures, bonds, and spiritual encounters inspire the game\u2019s mystery and emotional depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brought to Life with Full Voice Acting</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse